            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "E96"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent recipe to make spinach taste pretty good! I recommend going extra sparingly on the lemon juice; too much and you’ll overpower every other flavor and end up with bitter spinach. Mediterranean sea salt goes well with garlic powder if you don’t have garlic salt readily available.",
            "datePublished": "2021-01-26T02:37:43.640Z"
          },
          {
