            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Carol A"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious. The 2nd time I made it I Added shaved Parmesan and Asiago cheese and substituted olive oil for the butter. Finally I’m a spinach fan!",
            "datePublished": "2023-07-14T20:59:42.772Z"
          },
